OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies urged to talk about being
OL,4,Akind to animals
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal charity is asking parents and
OL,7,Fcarers to talk to their children about
OL,8,Finteracting with animals with kindness.
OL,10,FThe JSPCA said several welfare
OL,11,Fincidents involving wild and domestic
OL,12,Fanimals during the summer had prompted
OL,13,Fthe request.
OL,15,FThe charity's animal welfare lead
OL,16,Fadviser Tracy Millington said young
OL,17,Fpeople should be taught about how
OL,18,Fanimals communicate and when they need
OL,19,Fspace.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
