OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies urged to talk about being
OL,4,Akind to animals
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A few simple conversations can help
OL,7,Fchildren understand an animal's
OL,8,Fboundaries, recognise signs of fear or
OL,9,Fstress and learn how to interact with
OL,10,Fanimals safely and respectfully," she
OL,11,Fsaid.
